{"asset_key":"ep6/herohub_story_16411221","episode":"ep6","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"16411221","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1641122101:1":{"text":"꿀꺽꿀꺽... 정말 시원하고 달콤해! 마법 아이스 음료에 자잘한 기포가 엄청 많아. 마시면 뱃속에서 보글보글 터지는데 꼭 작은 불꽃놀이를 하는 거 같아!","source_cn":"咕噜噜……好凉好甜！这杯魔法冰饮里有好多小气泡，喝下去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60887650A9B3DC37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1641122102:1":{"text":"캬아, 시원하다!","source_cn":"哈啊——好爽快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C0209E06AC085C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1641122103:1":{"text":"...그걸 다 마셨어? 그거 주전자 하나 양인데?","source_cn":"……你都喝光了？那可是一整壶的份量吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41FB75986C4B1DA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1641122104:1":{"text":"어쩔 수 없잖아. 거품이 계속 올라와서 다 마시지 않으면 도망가 버릴 텐데!","source_cn":"没办法嘛，它自己在冒泡泡，我不喝完泡泡就会跑掉的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD10D332BBCF9957A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1641122105:1":{"text":"정말 괜찮아...? 네 배가 부풀어서 아까보다 둥글해졌어.","source_cn":"真的没事吗……你的肚子都鼓起来了，比之前还要圆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6FBE446A6670EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1641122106:1":{"text":"으아, 한 걸음도 못 걷겠다... 배가 너무 무거워.","source_cn":"呜哇，真的走不动了……肚子好沉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE28F183676F977F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1641122107:1":{"text":"마스터, 저 못 일어나겠어요... 저 좀 당겨 주세요...","source_cn":"主人，我站不起来了……你们拉我一把吧……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x31AB35A905826610","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 저 못 일어나겠어요... 저 좀 당겨 주세요...","female":"마스터, 저 못 일어나겠어요... 저 좀 당겨 주세요...","variant_male_record_index":"209659","variant_female_record_index":"209660","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}